[{'id': 4729565, 'title': None, 'body': '<p>I am detail oriented and would like to moderate this site to keep it a clean and fun place to visit everyday.</p>', 'accepted_answer_id': None, 'answer_count': None, 'comment_count': 0, 'community_owned_date': 1295388234897000, 'creation_date': 1295388234897000, 'favorite_count': None, 'last_activity_date': 1295388234897000, 'last_edit_date': 1295388234897000, 'last_editor_display_name': None, 'last_editor_user_id': 171206, 'owner_display_name': None, 'owner_user_id': 171206, 'parent_id': None, 'post_type_id': 6, 'score': 0, 'tags': None, 'view_count': None}, {'id': 4729601, 'title': None, 'body': '<p>Back when he was in high school, my dad ran for senior class president on the slogan of </p>\n\n<blockquote>\n  <p>"Slicer is Nicer".</p>\n</blockquote>\n\n<p>Well, I may certainly be nice too, and that will be tempered with patience, respect and professionalism.  As a professional developer for over 15 years and a technology hobbyist since 1982, I believe you\'ll find I will do well to keep this community moving forward and bringing the best practices of development to aspiring technologists.</p>', 'accepted_answer_id': None, 'answer_count': None, 'comment_count': 0, 'community_owned_date': 1295388481350000, 'creation_date': 1295388481350000, 'favorite_count': None, 'last_activity_date': 1295388481350000, 'last_edit_date': 1295388481350000, 'last_editor_display_name': None, 'last_editor_user_id': 3312, 'owner_display_name': None, 'owner_user_id': 3312, 'parent_id': None, 'post_type_id': 6, 'score': 0, 'tags': None, 'view_count': None}, {'id': 4729691, 'title': None, 'body': '<p>I firmly believe that a good moderator is like a good pre-school teacher.  Willing to listen to all, to help others better themselves, be there to arbitrate disagreements and able to learn from their <em>own</em> mistakes.  I may not be the best developer around (there are many before me who have a better claim to that title), but I think I can be fair.</p>\n\n<p>Holy crap, I just compared all the members of this site to pre-school children.  Well, there goes <em>my</em> nomination!</p>', 'accepted_answer_id': None, 'answer_count': None, 'comment_count': 0, 'community_owned_date': 1295389143423000, 'creation_date': 1295389143423000, 'favorite_count': None, 'last_activity_date': 1295389143423000, 'last_edit_date': 1295389143423000, 'last_editor_display_name': None, 'last_editor_user_id': 437768, 'owner_display_name': None, 'owner_user_id': 437768, 'parent_id': None, 'post_type_id': 6, 'score': 0, 'tags': None, 'view_count': None}, {'id': 4729708, 'title': None, 'body': '<p>I want to put it on my <strike>college application</strike> CV.</p>', 'accepted_answer_id': None, 'answer_count': None, 'comment_count': 0, 'community_owned_date': 1295389242057000, 'creation_date': 1295389242057000, 'favorite_count': None, 'last_activity_date': 1295389242057000, 'last_edit_date': 1295389242057000, 'last_editor_display_name': None, 'last_editor_user_id': 114994, 'owner_display_name': None, 'owner_user_id': 114994, 'parent_id': None, 'post_type_id': 6, 'score': 0, 'tags': None, 'view_count': None}, {'id': 4729774, 'title': None, 'body': '<p>Just another avid SO lover and proponent throwing his hat in the ring to hopefully continue to  grow and continue to refine the community and the invaluable intellectual resource that is StackOverflow.</p>\n\n<p>One merit I would say proves my dedication and love of this place is my receiving the designation as the Top "Top New User" my joining week.</p>\n\n<p>Thanks!</p>', 'accepted_answer_id': None, 'answer_count': None, 'comment_count': 0, 'community_owned_date': 1295389653187000, 'creation_date': 1295389653187000, 'favorite_count': None, 'last_activity_date': 1295389653187000, 'last_edit_date': 1295389653187000, 'last_editor_display_name': None, 'last_editor_user_id': 555384, 'owner_display_name': None, 'owner_user_id': 555384, 'parent_id': None, 'post_type_id': 6, 'score': 0, 'tags': None, 'view_count': None}]

