[{'id': 5166749, 'title': None, 'body': '<p>OpenWrap is a dependency manager for the .net platform.  It can be found at <a href="http://openwrap.org" rel="nofollow">http://openwrap.org</a>.</p>', 'accepted_answer_id': None, 'answer_count': None, 'comment_count': 0, 'community_owned_date': None, 'creation_date': 1299064856873000, 'favorite_count': None, 'last_activity_date': 1315422474080000, 'last_edit_date': 1315422474080000, 'last_editor_display_name': 'user1228', 'last_editor_user_id': None, 'owner_display_name': 'user1228', 'owner_user_id': None, 'parent_id': None, 'post_type_id': 5, 'score': 0, 'tags': None, 'view_count': None}, {'id': 5399041, 'title': None, 'body': '<p>Questions in this category contains all aspects of development relating to poker - ie. hand evaluation, game engine, statistics, etc.</p>', 'accepted_answer_id': None, 'answer_count': None, 'comment_count': 0, 'community_owned_date': None, 'creation_date': 1300835798970000, 'favorite_count': None, 'last_activity_date': 1311717572400000, 'last_edit_date': 1311717572400000, 'last_editor_display_name': 'user806549', 'last_editor_user_id': None, 'owner_display_name': 'user806549', 'owner_user_id': None, 'parent_id': None, 'post_type_id': 5, 'score': 0, 'tags': None, 'view_count': None}, {'id': 5410995, 'title': None, 'body': '<p><a href="http://msdn.microsoft.com/en-us/library/system.windows.automation.automationelement.aspx" rel="nofollow">AutomationElement</a> represents a UI Automation element in the UI Automation tree, and contains values used as identifiers by UI Automation client applications.  It is found within the <a href="http://msdn.microsoft.com/en-us/library/ms590934.aspx" rel="nofollow">System.Windows.Automation</a> namespace.</p>', 'accepted_answer_id': None, 'answer_count': None, 'comment_count': 0, 'community_owned_date': None, 'creation_date': 1300910873303000, 'favorite_count': None, 'last_activity_date': 1300910873303000, 'last_edit_date': 1300910873303000, 'last_editor_display_name': 'user1228', 'last_editor_user_id': None, 'owner_display_name': 'user1228', 'owner_user_id': None, 'parent_id': None, 'post_type_id': 5, 'score': 0, 'tags': None, 'view_count': None}, {'id': 6369460, 'title': None, 'body': '<p>Because a permalink remains unchanged indefinitely, it is less susceptible to link rot. Most modern weblogging and content-syndication software systems support such links. Other types of websites use the term permanent links, but the term permalink is most common within the blogosphere. Permalink is a portmanteau word made from permanent link. Permalinks are often simply stated so as to be human-readable.</p>', 'accepted_answer_id': None, 'answer_count': None, 'comment_count': 0, 'community_owned_date': None, 'creation_date': 1308215297363000, 'favorite_count': None, 'last_activity_date': 1308215741840000, 'last_edit_date': 1308215741840000, 'last_editor_display_name': 'user757425', 'last_editor_user_id': None, 'owner_display_name': 'user757425', 'owner_user_id': None, 'parent_id': None, 'post_type_id': 5, 'score': 0, 'tags': None, 'view_count': None}, {'id': 6526901, 'title': None, 'body': '<p>Questions in this tag are only for questions related to the PCI Local Bus standard which is a computer bus for attaching hardware devices in a computer.</p>', 'accepted_answer_id': None, 'answer_count': None, 'comment_count': 0, 'community_owned_date': None, 'creation_date': 1309379626643000, 'favorite_count': None, 'last_activity_date': 1309379943670000, 'last_edit_date': 1309379943670000, 'last_editor_display_name': 'user195488', 'last_editor_user_id': None, 'owner_display_name': 'user195488', 'owner_user_id': None, 'parent_id': None, 'post_type_id': 5, 'score': 0, 'tags': None, 'view_count': None}]

